OL,3,GNEWSAMore funds needed for pier
OL,4,Aredevelopment - council
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe cost of a major harbour
OL,7,Fredevelopment project in Scarborough
OL,8,Fhas increased since the plan was
OL,9,Fapproved, North Yorkshire Council has
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FThe project, green-lit by the former
OL,13,FScarborough Borough Council, includes
OL,14,Frestoring existing heritage facilities
OL,15,Falongside creating new commercial
OL,16,Fbuildings and public facilities such as
OL,17,Ftoilets and parking.
OL,19,FCouncillors said in May the scheme was
OL,20,Fexpected to cost about #15m, of which
OL,21,F#1.7m had been spent so far.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
