OL,3,GNEWSAMore funds needed for pier
OL,4,Aredevelopment - council
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn increase in costs means additional
OL,7,Ffunding is needed, council documents
OL,8,Fsaid. This is expected to be less than
OL,9,F#1m but the exact figure is yet to be
OL,10,Fannounced.
